{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1350039-idle-thought-experiment-the-knight-bus","id":1350039,"title":"Idle thought experiment: the Knight bus","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-21T10:15:20-08:00","id":1350039,"title":"Idle thought experiment: the Knight bus","content":"As part of an amusing thought experiment, I decided to try to make the Knight bus (or an approximation of it), from Harry potter movies with spells from the Mage magic system.<br /> <br /> It's an approximation, and the only important part i'm missing is how the conductor would detect stranded witches and wizards.<br /> <br /> Required:<br /> Break boundaries (Space 2), with the reach option to pass through narrow pathways, and a long duration<br /> Ground eater (Space 1), with a +2 reach options to change the speed addition to multiplication ala Acceleration (time 3)<br /> Incognito presence (Mind 2)<br /> Nice to have:<br /> Perpetual motion (Forces 3)<br /> Machine invisibility (Matter 2)<br /> <br /> I'm also unsure as to whether they would have to be imbued or if simple enhancing would be enough.<br /> <br /> Anyone care to join in on the slightly wacky brainstorming session?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11997-movingmind","name":"MovingMind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T11:49:46-08:00","id":1350077,"title":"","content":"The shrunken head is an animatronic programmed to say &quot;random&quot; words, its been enhanced with a mix of Green Light/Red Light and Serendipity to always say phrases that allow the driver to arrive at the right time to pick up a passenger.<br /> <br /> The food cart has a mix of Endless Bounty and Veil of Moments, to make sure food is always available and fresh. The whole bus has some Fate magic worked in so its twists and turns don't inconvenience any passengers or damage their luggage, while keeping the sensation of speed.<br /> <br /> Finally, the driver's glasses have been enhanced by Zoom In, Quantum Flux and Veil of Moments. This allows them to anticipate and react to bigger problems, while also preventing them from succumbing to fatigue, which has proven vital in emergencies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-21-2019, 04:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T15:22:08-08:00","id":1350139,"title":"","content":"Calling a teleportation spell with a key set to simply lifting ones wand or dedicated tool. Should work with little to no other arcana but if you wanted it can use fate.<br /> <br /> The mages shouldnt need to cast any spells themselves as the bus needs to visit *anyone* but if you want to make sure it only picks up qualified mages, stipulate that mages need to raise their wand and pulse their nimbus. The Knight NimBus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T04:18:29-08:00","id":1350207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1350039-idle-thought-experiment-the-knight-bus?p=1350077#post1350077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The shrunken head is an animatronic programmed to say &quot;random&quot; words, its been enhanced with a mix of Green Light/Red Light and Serendipity to always say phrases that allow the driver to arrive at the right time to pick up a passenger.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool idea with the Green light/Red light.<br /> The serendipity one is a bit pushing it though. With fate i would have gone with &quot;shifting the odds&quot; but as written it takes too much time. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The spell can find someone with a specific Trait, occupation, or context-specific quality (e.g. \u201ccorrupt cop\u201d), but it only locates the nearest or most available subject matching the description<br /> the mage provides, never a specific person or object (although destiny sometimes draws familiar faces together). </div> </div> </div>If the spell can find the nearest &quot;corrupt cop&quot;, a &quot;stranded witch/wizard&quot; should be easy enough... maybe a combination with &quot;locate object&quot; to actually know where they are?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1350039-idle-thought-experiment-the-knight-bus?p=1350077#post1350077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The food cart has a mix of Endless Bounty and Veil of Moments, to make sure food is always available and fresh. The whole bus has some Fate magic worked in so its twists and turns don't inconvenience any passengers or damage their luggage, while keeping the sensation of speed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually chose to Ground eater to avoid the sensation of speed... it would be quite uncomfortable <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> but yea, for accuracy, yours is probably better. With Break Boundary, there is much less actual swerving involved though.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1350039-idle-thought-experiment-the-knight-bus?p=1350077#post1350077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Finally, the driver's glasses have been enhanced by Zoom In, Quantum Flux and Veil of Moments. This allows them to anticipate and react to bigger problems, while also preventing them from succumbing to fatigue, which has proven vital in emergencies.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scarlet Witch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1350039-idle-thought-experiment-the-knight-bus?p=1350139#post1350139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Calling a teleportation spell with a key set to simply lifting ones wand or dedicated tool. Should work with little to no other arcana but if you wanted it can use fate.<br /> The mages shouldnt need to cast any spells themselves as the bus needs to visit *anyone* but if you want to make sure it only picks up qualified mages, stipulate that mages need to raise their wand and pulse their nimbus. The Knight NimBus.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually wanted to avoid Teleportation. If the bus can teleport itself, well it kind of defeats the point of being bus shaped, since journeys would be instant. And if calling the bus requires space 4... yea... why not just teleport yourself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11997-movingmind","name":"MovingMind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}